    },
    {
      "start": 455.93,
      "end": 457.41,
      "text": "- Why the hell is she still alive?"
    },
    {
      "start": 457.41,
      "end": 460.313,
      "text": "He was ordered to eliminate her, not to bring her back."
    },
    {
      "start": 461.63,
      "end": 464.18,
      "text": "- He made a field call."
    },
    {
      "start": 464.18,
      "end": 465.653,
      "text": "He thinks she has potential."
    },
    {
      "start": 466.7,
      "end": 468.589,
      "text": "Director's willing to let him run with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 468.589,
      "end": 471.339,
      "text": "(metal clanging)"
    },
    {
      "start": 483.746,
      "end": 485.14,
      "text": "- So, what do we got?"
    },
    {
      "start": 485.14,
      "end": 488.91,
      "text": "- Nothing, no ID, no matches on dental, DNA."
    },
    {
      "start": 488.91,
      "end": 491.21,
      "text": "Nothing on her but some clothes and an old tape deck."
    },
    {
      "start": 491.21,
      "end": 492.85,
      "text": "- A little young to be an asset, isn't she?"
    },
    {
      "start": 492.85,
      "end": 494.22,
      "text": "- Don't let her fool you."
    },
    {
      "start": 494.22,
      "end": 497.42,
      "text": "She took out six guys in six seconds with no weapons"
    },
    {
      "start": 497.42,
      "end": 498.253,
      "text": "and no training."
    },
    {
      "start": 499.346,
      "end": 503.197,
      "text": "(footsteps approaching)"
    },
    {
      "start": 503.197,
      "end": 506.03,
