      "text": "(Charlie panting)"
    },
    {
      "start": 525.29,
      "end": 527.443,
      "text": "Where are we, what is this?"
    },
    {
      "start": 527.443,
      "end": 529.493,
      "text": "- A place where we bring people like you."
    },
    {
      "start": 531.41,
      "end": 534.87,
      "text": "Actually, this place was built with the express purpose"
    },
    {
      "start": 534.87,
      "end": 539.87,
      "text": "of finding and eliminating people with your condition."
    },
    {
      "start": 541.02,
      "end": 542.243,
      "text": "- Why am I here?"
    },
    {
      "start": 543.2,
      "end": 544.7,
      "text": "- You mean, why are you alive?"
    },
    {
      "start": 547.03,
      "end": 548.993,
      "text": "You are still alive because,"
    },
    {
      "start": 550.52,
      "end": 551.72,
      "text": "because you are special."
    },
    {
      "start": 553.01,
      "end": 557.64,
      "text": "You have abilities that we can use."
    },
    {
      "start": 557.64,
      "end": 559.037,
      "text": "- Use how?"
