    },
    {
      "start": 561.57,
      "end": 563.733,
      "text": "- To hunt others down like yourself."
    },
    {
      "start": 565.91,
      "end": 567.46,
      "text": "Well, we know you're out there."
    },
    {
      "start": 568.682,
      "end": 569.599,
      "text": "Everywhere."
    },
    {
      "start": 571.434,
      "end": 574.184,
      "text": "Thousands of you hiding among us,"
